Package: dev.playday3008.lowerinstall
Name: LowerInstall
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader, firmware (>= 9.0)
Conflicts: com.julioverne.lowerinstall
Description: Install apps that require a newer iOS version. Hooks installd to skip device-family/thinning/metadata checks, and spoofs the App Store User-Agent (itunesstored on iOS 9, appstored on iOS 10+) so metadata servers return IPAs for a spoofed OS version. Inspired by julioverne/LowerInstall.
Maintainer: PlayDay <18056374+playday3008@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: PlayDay
Section: Tweaks
